title: Word from Moscow
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and moscow_timer <= 0
on-arrival: moscow_timer = 4; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
tags: international

= Word from Moscow

[? if comintern_rep : [+ comintern_rep +], ?][? if comintern_rep = 0 : An envoy of the Bolsheviks, ?] travelling on false papers, has asked to see the Zentrale. [? if comintern_member = 0 : Lenin's party wants a say in how the German revolution is made, and it can offer money in return. ?][? if comintern_member = 1 : The Executive of the Communist International has views on the German section's work, and it pays a good share of the section's bills. ?]

- @funds: Ask for money.
- @advice: Follow Moscow's advice.
- @distance: Keep our distance.
- @easy_discard

@funds
subtitle: 2 funds. Moscow's money comes with expectations.
on-arrival: resources += 2; independence -= 6; luxemburgist_satisfaction -= 2

The envoy is generous. He is also taking notes.

@advice
subtitle: [? if lock_moscow_orders = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Draws us closer to the Bolsheviks. The Left approves.
choose-if: lock_moscow_orders < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids taking orders from Moscow.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_moscow_orders == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.independence -= 5;
Q.world_revolution += 3;
Q.offensive_satisfaction += 8;
Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction -= 5;
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
!}

We follow Moscow's advice. The Bolsheviks have made a revolution; we have not yet.

@distance
subtitle: The Spartacists approve. Moscow is cooler.
on-arrival: independence += 5; luxemburgist_satisfaction += 5; offensive_satisfaction -= 5; lean_luxemburgist += 1

The German revolution will be made by German workers. We thank our visitor for his interest.
